    "chunk_text": "orston hine So\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00feanc eode on hig, hwylc hyra yldest w\u00e6re. \u00d0a se H\u00e6lend geseh hyra heortan ge\u00feancas, he gesette \u00fe\u00e6ne cnapan wi\u00fe hine & cw\u00e6\u00fe to him, Se \u00f0e \u00d0a andswarode Iohannes, bebeodend, we gesawon sumne on \u00feinum naman deofolseocnessa \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, ne forbeode ge. Se \u00f0e nis ongen eow se is for eow. So\u00f0lice w\u00e6s geworden \u00fea his andfenga dagas w\u00e6ron gefyllede; he getrymede hys ansyne \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00d0a sende he bodan beforan his ansyne, \u00fea eodon hig on \u00fea ceastre Samaritanorum \u00fe\u00e6t hi him & hig ne onfengon hine for\u00feam \u00fee he wolde faran to Hierusalem. \u00d0a his leorningcnihtas \u00fe\u00e6t gesawon, Iacobus & Iohannes, \u00fea cw\u00e6don hig, Drihten, wyltu we secga\u00f0 And hine bewende he hig \u00fereade, & hig ferdon on o\u00feer castel. \u00d0a hi ferdon on wege, sum him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic fylige \u00fee swa hwyder swa \u00feu f\u00e6rst. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend, foxas habba\u00f0 holu & heofones fuglas nest\u00fe; So\u00f0lice mannes sunu n\u00e6f\u00fe hwar he \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe he to o\u00f0rum filig me. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe he, drihten, alyf me \u00e6ryst bebyrigean minne f\u00e6der. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend, l\u00e6t \u00fea dead byrigan hyra deadan. Ga \u00f0u & boda Godes rice. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 o\u00f0er, ic",
